Docs: Project Documentation

Purpose:
  Project documentation mapping, audience assignment, and ownership
  routing. .sdd/projects/sddra.ai/docs/ maps human-readable docs to their
  .sdd counterparts and defines audience, ownership, and freshness
  rules.

